# Contact form: emails you directly when this is set.
# 1. Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com (enter the email that should receive messages).
# 2. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the key below, then restart `npm run dev`.
# 3. On Vercel/Netlify, add the same variable in the project's environment settings.
# The key is safe to expose in the browser: it can only send mail TO your inbox.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
